cc35cbe1.webm?t=1757610478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/fabb16a3ad5fa0cae262128dcc35cbe1.mp4?t=1757610478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the lives of an ensemble cast whose stories unfold as you connect with them. Through a \u201csocial link\u201d system, the more you engage with their work, the more you discover who they are. Take a moment to gather at the Wellspring\u2019s bar, a space to linger, share, and deepen bonds\u2014where quiet conversations reveal the threads that tie everyone together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/2b7a90d758c090010b269c24d8284acb.poster.avif?t=1757610478\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/2b7a90d758c090010b269c24d8284acb.webm?t=1757610478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/extras/2b7a90d758c090010b269c24d8284acb.mp4?t=1757610478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERBEAT</strong> lives beyond its own songs with full support to create and share your own charts. Put your own music in the game or download others\u2019 off the community workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Alice Bottino","CHANCELLOR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/204f97d79209a57065b46b988ba571afe880d96d/header.jpg?t=1757610478","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai